  "description": "FAPWUR crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 Lu5 O25. From the CIF bond table, Lu1 (Lu) has 8 O neighbors; Lu2 (Lu) has 12 O neighbors; Lu1A (Lu) has 8 O neighbors; Lu1B (Lu) has 8 O neighbors; Lu1C (Lu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.472-4.911 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.40-155.42°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H115Lu5O25. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
